            </note>
            <note corresp="#d53-f2" n="1" xml:id="d53-f2-content">
                <p>Wyndham White was in Washington September 10–12 to discuss with Department of
                    State officials GATT matters to be brought before the 13th session, which met in
                    Geneva October 16–November 22.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
